00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:21.630
So if you didn't see forecasting
stock returns with TensorFlow,

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.960
Cloud ML Engine, and Thomson
Reuters Tick Data in BigQuery,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.810
